{
  "sleep control": "睡眠控场",
  "Every few basic attacks put an enemy to sleep with Drowse, and anything that wakes from her sleep is Haunted and weaker. Sleeping enemies lose their cooldowns, their armor and their healing; her ult wakes them into nightmares. The signature leaves the Hush of Callowmere after her ult, putting the whole field back to sleep.": "每隔几次普攻，困倦会使一名敌人入睡。从莉萨拉的睡眠中醒来的敌人会受到梦魇纠缠并变弱。沉睡的敌人损失冷却、护甲和治疗，终极技能会将他们唤入噩梦。招牌天赋会让醒来的敌人再睡一次。",
  "link healer": "连结治疗者",
  "Dreamthread pairs carry each other's damage, and the moon turns every {0} s between stronger heals and stronger shields. Cocoons that hold to the end hatch their ally into a faster, stronger fighter. Dreamthread and Moon Cocoon grow to cover more allies; the signature keeps a linked ally alive through a killing blow.": "由梦线连结的盟友分担伤害。月亮每 {0} 秒在强化治疗和强化护盾之间切换。撑到最后的茧会孵出更快、更强的盟友。梦线和月之茧能保护更多盟友。招牌天赋使连结的盟友免受致命一击。",
  "caster punisher": "施法惩戒者",
  "Her dust settles on every enemy she hits and flares when they try to cast. She hunts the Lantern, the enemy with the most ability power, and her blinding dust turns misses into ultimate energy. Queen of Quiet Wings becomes a fuse; the signature flares every Dust on the field and drags the Lantern into the fire.": "鳞粉落在每个被击中的敌人身上，并在他们施法时爆燃。她把技能强度最高的敌人当作灯笼追猎。致盲鳞粉将攻击落空转为终极技能能量。静翼女王化作引信。招牌天赋点燃全场鳞粉，把灯笼拉入火中。"
}
